d":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.99534446,35.05243891]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"もりやま芦刈園","category":"nature","address":"守山市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"25207","municipality_pref":"滋賀県","municipality_name":"守山市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[135.95230602,35.0777196]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"堀海道児童公園","category":"nature","address":"守山市","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"25207","municipality_pref":"滋賀県","municipality_name":"守山市","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[136.00185359,35.05721507]}}],"display_comment_original":"守山市周辺には、近世村の記憶として守山村、立入村、岡村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、吉身西遺跡、下之郷遺跡、播磨田東遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、守山村、立入村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":["曲直瀬道三","立入宗康","岡田博"],"notable_people":["曲直瀬道三","立入宗康","岡田博","宇野宗佑","古高俊太郎"],"honorary_citizens":["宇野宗佑","森口華弘"],"tourism_landmarks":["金森御坊（金森懸所）","立入城","服部陣屋（服部城）","浮気城","三宅城","守山城","矢島御所","小島城（児島城）"],"specialties":["守山メロン"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%88%E5%B1%B1%E5%B8%82","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1670090","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17211578","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11473470","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q315591","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11411767","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17220099","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11597772","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11473720","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11473496","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11473430","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11473626","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11367532","https://jpsearch.go.jp/